This site's design system is derived from My Scholar (also published as
astro-scholar), an Astro theme by My (Chiffon) Nguyen.

    https://github.com/mychiffonn/myscholar
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Files in src/styles/ are adapted from that project — the OKLCH colour
token structure, the Utopia fluid spacing and grid scale, the type scale,
and the base typography, card, bar, icon-button and disclosure rules.
Colours, fonts and several component treatments have been changed for
this site. Several components in src/components/ follow its structure and
naming conventions.

My Scholar is itself built on astro-erudite by enscribe, also Apache-2.0:

    https://github.com/jktrn/astro-erudite

Icon paths in src/components/Icon.astro are from Mingcute (Apache-2.0):

    https://github.com/Richard9394/MingCute

